From e1b213bebef3e5d7d699c079d243a6d40154e096 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 16:07:06 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(www,resume): write the release labels server's set check
 reads (RELEASE R8)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

resume-render provides resume-api=1 and www requires it, so home's release
can refuse a www beside a résumé service older than it calls. Each publish
workflow checks the labels parse before it pushes, as render's does. Records
the server half's calls, C740-C744 (server#853).

Change-Kind: story
Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01LDpdUFgNLPvysbZzJXeqba
